      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibaá nee tsár oo waawuti'iimár Ahasi oo Yuda Hoshea garmoó Ela waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún baraá Israeliro. Inós baraá waawuti'iimaro kureeri ngaa /aáy a gwaleél baraá gixsár Samariaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós tlakweema gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, ala tlakweemawo adoodár waawitaáduú Israeli dirose aa giirin gaa ayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Shalmanesa oo Ashuru guna i haraatláy, Hoshea iri sagadiyusmoó Shalmanesa tleehhiít, ohme gari hanmiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala qoomarka wake Hoshea afo gana ya/aáw amór waawutmo So oo Misri as alee/isaay nguwa firin. Inós ohme hanimisuwo gari sií' dír waawutmo Shalmanesa oo Ashuru, adoodár /iisí umuú kurko i tlehhaahhiti. Shalmanesa adoorí ngiwa ár, Hoshea guri óh, guri tseék ar piíngu guri dahaás baraá doó tseegamo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmoó Ashuru yaamu sleémeero awa Israeli giri haraadáh, iri hardáh ay gixsár Samaria, gari harweér har afiqoomár kureeraá tame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú gwaleél oo waawuti'iimár Hosheawo, waawutmoó Ashuru gixsár Samaria gana hayóh, nee múk Israeli guri ar tláy ay yaamaá Ashuru. Muu guna bahh qaás baraá gixsár Hala, bahh'alé dír afaá yaaér Habori, nee yaaér Gosani nee bahh'alé baraá gixsár Media.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí ina tleehharút asma múk Israeli ina dee/anuút dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúine, kudá' gaa tuu/ baraá dabaá Faraowo, waawutmoó Misri, nee sleeme munguaá hatlá' ngina sagadiyusiyé' kitángw Munguú ló' wa ale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "slooír xoordaá hatlá' ngiri eehariyé', kudá' aáng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa guús geeraaín wa ale, nee tlehhmi'iidaá waawituú Israeli aa tlehhiít dír múk yaamuudá' wa aleeró ngiri aleealuusiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli muruú qoomaaká nguna naaqo tlehhiitiyé' dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúine. Wa/aameedár gongoama' ar munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmisi ngiri tleehhiyé' baraá umuú gixsaro, iimír dír /aampár xuumuusér wa tleemu ay baraá gixsaduudá' taa tleéhh ar koo/ír gawit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá umuú gongoamoowo nee dír kiintuú loo/ór naá/ koóm, uheemaá tlaa/e nee murslaaqatuú munguúduú /ameeni ta bay Ashera nguna tleehhiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mooyángw tsuú' kuri da/aa/án gawaá wa/aameedá' sleémeero ar gongooama', inooín slooír xoordaá hatlá' kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa guús ngina eehariyé'. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguri buhhtisiyé' ar tlakweemaaín kudá' naa tleehhiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munguaá murslaaqat ngina sagadiyusiyé', kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iwa kaahi, «Adoosíng ma tleehhara'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aaruuse nee iigu'utuuse gana ya/aáw as múk Israeli kuwa nanaaqi nee oo Yudawo, iwa kaahi, «Lohduhúng kwisingá' tlakw mawaak, hara'ayar'eé' iiárií qaasaak, nee daber'eé' eeharaak, tidá' aníng aáng na hara'ayiím dír baabi'iihúng, nee tidá' na hara'iyiím ar loohír sagadiyuser'eé' ar aaruuse.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inooín tí ngaa iiárií qaasi'iiká, inooín kin sage gawden adór baabi'ii'ín kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín, ngwa si'iye' haratlintaooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabeerós eeharto ngina si'iyé', alqadoodá' aa qaás nee baabi'ii'ín nga oohi'iiká, tam adoorihe naanaqarós ngina si'iyé'. Inooín murslaaqatuú tawo nguna harahhifiyé', inooín nay lamuuse tleehhitiyé', slooír xoordaá hatlá' awa yaamuudá' ngina eehaariyé', tam handá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngaa bayi, «Slooir'ín ma oohara'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín sleémeero ngina si'iyé', nee murslaaqataá tsár ngiri tleehhiyé' ar slaqsa'aá damaay, as tawa munguín, slám slaqsoó munguú /ameeni kuduú Ashera nguna tleehhiyé', nee tsatse/uú doori nguri sluufmisiyé', nee Ba'ali nguri sagadiyusiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na/ii'ín awa daaqaay nee awa dasuwo ngina ilahhooár da/tá wa hanmiisiyé' dír munguaá lama, inooín dír qwaslaare nee da/aluuse ngina kakayé' as kiwa yaahamiisi kángw hotaaine. Inooín tina ló'wa haniisiyé' baraá tlakweema, dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, gawaá adoorihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguri buhhtisiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk Israeli guri ló'wa i buúhh, guri guús dír geeraawose. Heé taa máy i kaahh aqo har tlahhoó Yuda kilós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam múk Yuda hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín, ngaa iialoesi'iiká, inooín slooidár xoordaá hatlá', tidá' tinda huúw nee múk Israeli ngina oohiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk Israeli guri sií' sleémeero, giri muúx ar loohír xoordaá xaraaslá', sleémeero kiri hhaamiís dír geeraawose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk Israeli nguwa paraátl dír tlahhoó Daudiwo, inooín Yeroboamu garmoó Nebati nguna tsawaariyé' waawutmooín wa ale. Yeroboamu múk Israeli guri geerahaár, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa maya', giri dahaás baraá tlakweemaá ur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli tlakweemadá' Yeroboamu aa tlehhiít inooín sleeme ngina tlehhiitiyé', slám nga baloó may'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alhhe'eesaywo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ inooín giri qwaareés dír geeraawose ar adoodá' ngira naanaáq ar loohír sagadiyuuserós ar aaruuse. Gawaá adoorihe, múk Israeli kuri ar tláy ay baraá yaamaá Ashuru, ay nee laarí ta hotaatín amoodá' wa aleeró.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
