        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmoó Ashuru muu guna Babuloni wa ar tláy, nee Kuta, nee Afa, nee Hamati nee Sefarfaimu guri huúw baraá gixsaadaá Samaria, didá' múk Israeli kuwa loohatís. Yaamuká' ngina kooín tleehhiyé' nee niri baraá gixsaaduuín wa hootiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár mukduú geera iwa baraadá' i dáh, inooín AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngwa haratlinti'i'iiká, gawaá adoorihe Mungú direeri giri ya/aáw, nee direeridá' muu bahh'ale nguri ohiné'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmoó Ashuru kuri báy, «Xoorduudá' kuúng taa húp baraá gixsadaá Samaria, dabér munguúduú baraá yaamuudá' ngi xuiaaká, gawaá adoorihe Munguúdá' direeri giri ya/aáw muu nguri ohiné'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmoó Ashuru iri oó', «Kaahamusmoó wák oo Mungú dír mukdá' tinda baraaká i huwi, amoodá' ti ki/ise' as muu nguwa intsaahhatisi daanduú dabér Munguúine.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe kaahamusmoó wák baraá mukdá' taa Samaria wa ar tlayi iri hotaá áy baraá yaamaá Beteli. Baraadae muu guri intsaahhatimís adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngur sluufmiisiya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala xoordu sleémeero kudaá baraá yaamaá Samaria hootá' tana kumiít slaqsa'aá mungú tlehhtuuwo, nee kiri qaás gawaá kiteeridá' taa tleéhh gawaá gongoama' nee múk Israeli. Umuú xoorooro slaqsoó munguúwós guna tléhh guri qás baraá gixsadá' inooín ta hooti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Babuloni slaqsoó Sukot-benoti nguna tleehhiyé', nee múk Kuti slaqsoó Nergali, nee múk Hamati slaqsoó Ashima nguna tleehhiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee múk Ifa slaqsoó Nibhasi, nee Tartaki nguna tleehhiyé', múk Sefarfaimu na/ii'ín ngina ilahhooár da/tá wa haniisiyé' dír munguiidá' ta babay Adrameleki nee Anameleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí sleeme AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguna sluufmisiyé'. Inooín muu nguna tsawaariyé' baraá tla/angw'ine múk umuúqo adooro as kiwa kaahamuusér wa qaasi ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i kawa hanmisi gawaá kiteeridá' gawaá gongoamá wá ale, as inooín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, inooín AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguna sluufmiisiyé', bartaqae inooín munguiidá' naa huwiyé' baraá yaamuuín wa alé ngina malé sluufmiisiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam hamí tlehhmi'ii'ín kudaá qaro kin alkón tlehhtuwo. Inooín Mungú ngu sluufmiisiaaká, laqaá adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i slai ngi eeharahariaaká nee dabeerose nee kaahirose. Hara'ayarí an tidá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa haniís dír na/aá Yakobo, kudá' aluuwo umuuwós aa báy, «Israeli.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aáng alqado gana oó' dir'ín, giri báy, «Munguaá hatlá' mi haratlintatiaara' nee mi i tumbarara'amitara', nee mi sagadiyuusara', laqaá mi ilahhooár muruú ta tsú/i hanmiisara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ na sluufmiisaré'. Anuúdá' kuungá' naa tuu/ baraá yaamaá Misriro ar dakw'eé' kudá' /uuruú koóm, nee aleesleemuú yaariír, na i tumbarara'ataré' nee ilahhooár muruú ta tsú/í hanmisaré'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú daqto kuungá' kaahir'eé' nee sla'aarir'eene nee dabeero, nee hara'ayaadá' tinda kuungií gooini, umuú deelo harmagahhaak tlehhtuuwo. Munguaá hatlá' mi sluufmiisara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laqaá alqadoodá' naa dirhúngí oó' ma gunqaaresara'. Munguaá hatlá' mi sluufmisuú awaara', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala aqo har aníng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kilós in sluufmisá', daqaní aníng kuungá' nu tuú/ baraá dabaá wakuuserhunge.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukdá' tidá' gaa iiárií qaasiiká, ala aqo ador'ín tidár geera ngina alkoné' tlehhtuuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
